Date: 10/1/2026

Objective: This lab is mainly about using the HSPICE simulation tool to explore the MOS transistor characteristics. 
Lab 1 will use HSPICE and WaveView to generate graphs to visualize these characteristics, 
such as sub-threshold swing, the body effect, DIBL, or temperature sensitivity.
